    </div>
    <div class="privacy-grid">
      <div>
        <strong>{t('公开展示', 'Shown publicly')}</strong>
        <p>{t('总容量、总占用、可用空间、GPU 型号与数量；站点 owner 只用相对标签“我”展示；其他账户继续匿名显示主目录、Docker 写入层与可归属合计。网页不公开任何系统用户名，也不保存其他用户的身份映射。', 'Total capacity, total usage, free space, GPU model/count; the site owner is shown only by the relative label “Me”; all other accounts remain anonymous with their home, Docker writable-layer, and attributable totals. The page publishes no system usernames and stores no identity mapping for other users.')}</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <strong>{t('不公开', 'Not shown')}</strong>
        <p>{t('owner 的系统用户名、其他用户的真实用户名、容器名、容器 ID、GPU 进程命令、GPU UUID、IP、SSH 别名、其他用户的匿名编号映射或任何可反查身份的信息。', 'The owner’s system username, other users’ real usernames, container names/IDs, GPU process commands, GPU UUIDs, IPs, SSH aliases, mappings for other users’ anonymous labels, or other identity-revealing details.')}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <details class="measurement-notes">
    <summary>{t('数据来源', 'Data sources')}</summary>
    <p>{t('主文件系统来自 df -B1 /；可识别账户的主目录来自只读 du；Docker 写入层来自容器 size 信息，并通过容器挂载到的 home 目录做匿名归属；无法可靠归属的容器写入层保留为单独一项。本次审计尝试读取 Docker system df，但共享 daemon 的一个历史 snapshot 不一致使 daemon-wide 汇总不可用，因此页面不把该汇总当成本次事实；共享镜像也不会被强行分摊给个人。CPU / GPU 规格已在本次快照重新核验。页面只保存 owner 的相对标签“我”和其他账户匿名后的容量数字，不保存任何系统用户名、SSH 地址、GPU UUID、容器名、容器 ID 或其他用户的匿名编号映射。', 'The main filesystem comes from df -B1 /; home-directory sizes for identifiable accounts come from read-only du measurements; Docker writable-layer sizes come from container size data and are anonymized by the home directory mounted into each container. Writable layers that cannot be reliably tied to an account remain separate. This audit attempted Docker system df, but a historical snapshot inconsistency in the shared daemon made the daemon-wide summary unavailable, so the page does not use that summary as a current fact; shared images are still not forced onto individual users. CPU/GPU specifications were rechecked in this snapshot. The page stores only the relative owner label “Me” plus anonymized capacity figures for other accounts; it stores no system usernames, SSH endpoints, GPU UUIDs, container names/IDs, or anonymous-label mappings for other users.')}</p>
  </details>
</main>

